  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Chair and CEO, Kevin Lobo, has been named among the top 100 chief executive officers in the 2021 Employees’ Choice Awards honoring Top CEOs released by Glassdoor, a career data website. The list highlights top leaders that employees love working for in countries throughout North America and parts of Europe. The awards are based on anonymized employee submissions and ratings over the last year on Glassdoor.com.</p>\n<p>“Through a challenging year, it’s inspiring to see Top CEOs who, according to their employees, adapted to change, redefined visions and led with transparency while putting the health and safety of employees first. I extend my sincerest congratulations to this year’s Employees’ Choice Award winners,” said Christian Sutherland-Wong, Glassdoor’s chief executive officer.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.glassdoor.com/Award/Top-CEOs-LST_KQ0,8.htm\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">View the list</span></a></p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 15 2021 18:30:59 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  },
